{"title":"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/a/53a923cf93fc30061a491ad7c2a51ecbf4259a53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2(\\log_3(\\log_4 x))=\\log_3(\\log_4(\\log_2 y))=\\log_4(\\log_2(\\log_3 z))=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"483\" height=\"18\" />, then the sum <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/6/786294ba81c75be655bda0e12c983b0ef8919a1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y+z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" /> is equal to\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/4/654ee66582079d5d877383057c2fecc474bc8e4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }50\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }58\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }89\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }111\\qquad  \\textbf{(E) }1296$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"425\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/4/ef45fc9385218a70770513b3a4e80869df05e7b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{x}{n}=0,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"83\" height=\"17\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/8/2385b0e0891be0535adffa04bc5c5e02b8477eb5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" /> So, we can rewrite this equation:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/1/d51fc92562d7ba118a4377cc369fba98da897653.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(\\log_3(\\log_4 x))=(\\log_4(\\log_2 y))=(\\log_2(\\log_3 z))=1\\]\" width=\"388\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Solve individually for each variable.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/9/de99d4ef41a23a458ee55bad66285f752a12c360.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x = 4^3 = 64\\]\" width=\"93\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/6/4d6f74045861823c22bac22ad5e5f818430d8024.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y = 2^4 = 16\\]\" width=\"91\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/d/06d8c10be6855cd8ff4c282b10f3e4f6a3127cee.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[z = 3^2 = 9\\]\" width=\"82\" height=\"15\" />\nTherefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/4/f3483b24cc64e0b27e4b18479352245a15aae5f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y + z = 89.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"119\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/8/1886a39c9a499d45708c820c5d34dd1f9c99ee43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }89}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"71\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>-edited by coolmath34\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME\" title=\"1971 AHSME\">1971 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1971 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1971\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/